or; border-left: none; border-right: 1pt solid rgb(229, 231, 235); border-style: none solid solid none; border-top: none; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; mso-border-alt: solid #E5E7EB .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #E5E7EB .25pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #E5E7EB .25pt; padding: 0.75pt;\" valign=\"bottom\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">3<o:p></o:p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 7;\">\n<td style=\"border-top: none; border: 1pt solid rgb(229, 231, 235); mso-border-alt: solid #E5E7EB .25pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #E5E7EB .25pt; padding: 0.75pt;\" valign=\"bottom\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span face='\"Segoe UI Emoji\",sans-serif' style='mso-bidi-font-family: \"Segoe UI Emoji\";'>🇨🇿</span> Czech\n  Republic<o:p></o:p></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-bottom: 1pt solid rgb(229, 231, 235); border-color: currentcolor rgb(229, 231, 235) rgb(229, 231, 235) currentcolor; border-left: none; border-right: 1pt solid rgb(229, 231, 235); border-style: none solid solid none; border-top: none; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; mso-border-alt: solid #E5E7EB .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #E5E7EB .25pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #E5E7EB .25pt; padding: 0.75pt;\" valign=\"bottom\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">1<o:p></o:p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 8;\">\n<td style=\"border-top: none; border: 1pt solid rgb(229, 231, 235); mso-border-alt: solid #E5E7EB .25pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #E5E7EB .25pt; padding: 0.75pt;\" valign=\"bottom\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span face='\"Segoe UI Emoji\",sans-serif' style='mso-bidi-font-family: \"Segoe UI Emoji\";'>🇫🇷</span> France<o:p></o:p></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-bottom: 1pt solid rgb(229, 231, 235); border-color: currentcolor rgb(229, 231, 235) rgb(229, 231, 235) currentcolor; border-left: none; border-right: 1pt solid rgb(229, 231, 235); border-style: none solid solid none; border-top: none; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; mso-border-alt: solid #E5E7EB .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #E5E7E